tc.research_name.TC_NTM_IMPOSSIBLE_OBSERVATION=An Impossible Observation
tc.research_text.TC_NTM_IMPOSSIBLE_OBSERVATION=Something returned a result
occultic_ntm.research.observation.1=The instrument returned a surprisingly ordinary classification: a human form, with a small absence where further detail should have been. Distance and poor light can account for many errors. I have recorded the reading for comparison with a second observation.<BR><BR>The figure remained quite still throughout the measurement. That, at least, was helpful.
occultic_ntm.research.observation.2=The absence was not an error. The instrument completed its measurement. There was nothing standing there when I lowered it.<BR><BR>I have repeated the calculation. I have checked the lens. I have checked the calculation again.<BR><BR>I do not remember turning toward the figure. I remember finding it already facing me.<BR><BR>The last line in my notes is not in my handwriting. It is a perfectly ordinary line. It gives my location.

# Rite of the Lung Ward
