occultic_ntm.rite.lung_ward.requirements=Altar Power: 500\nCircle: 7x7 Radiant Chalk (16)\nOfferings: 1x Paper, 1x Clay Ball, 1x Glass Bottle\nCondition: Practitioner must stand inside circle and have contaminated lungs
